# Next.js (App Router Only)

## App Router Required
- Use `/app` or `/src/app` only
- No `pages/` directory (legacy)

## Explicit Routes
- `/app/entity/create/page.tsx` → create form
- `/app/entity/[id]/page.tsx` → detail view
- `/app/entity/[id]/update/page.tsx` → update form
- `/app/entity/[id]/manage/page.tsx` → manage view

## No State Multiplexing
- Don't multiplex create/edit/show states in single route
- Routing represents application state clearly

## Server Components Default
- Use server components by default
- Client components only for stateful interactivity
